{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064417/block/singleImage/3270860/df/1554521987_K7.jpg?updatedAt=1794985006\"/><figcaption>深水埗富昌邨巴西龜高處墮地慘死，警帶走男戶主。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (18 日 ) 上午 11 時 55 分，警方接獲保安報案，指在富韻樓對開發現一隻直徑約長 8 吋的巴西龜倒臥地面，其龜殼爆裂並有血迹，懷疑牠由高處墮下。 人員接報後到場，經檢驗後證實巴西龜當場死亡，將案件列「殘酷對待動物」跟進，警員隨後登樓調查並帶走一名男住客，懷疑有人掟龜落街，而 單位內有多隻烏龜 ，愛護動物協會人員到場將龜屍檢走。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T07:27:40.491001+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":202,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:56:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T12:48:27.892628+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:20:59.990167+00:00","content_hash":"32f25cbbe046fbfc383e50b3f134a1b353dae92c517d9f0f9e1f02b447fca818","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T07:27:40.491001+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}